menu "Deskstrate HTTPS"

    config DESKSTRATE_TLS_DOMAIN
        string "Domain the boards' certificate covers (as *.<domain>)"
        default "deskstrate.nogsnet.com"
        help
            Each board's CSR asks for *.<domain>, so the board is reachable as
            <anything>.<domain> once a DNS record points that name at it (e.g.
            core.deskstrate.nogsnet.com). Changing it needs new CSRs in the repo
            (tls/<name>.csr, from GET /api/tls/csr); the key stays the same.

endmenu
